    "Each group: parent (a native tool group), order (Moddable Tool Groups orders a group's sub-groups and buildings by one scale: native buildings use about 10-90, so sub-groups follow them at 100+), name, icon (the LabeledEntitySpec icon of the listed template), and templates (Deep Frontier building template names without the faction suffix). A listed building's PlaceableBlockObjectSpec.ToolGroupId becomes the sub-group; its ToolOrder orders it inside."
